==Usage==

This template can be used for many [[item]]s such as [[Trophy|Trophies]], [[Common crafting material]]s, [[Rare crafting material]]s, [[Quest item]]s, [[Salvage item]]s, [[Kit]]s, [[Scroll]]s, and [[Alcohol]]. This template attempts to autotype and autocategorise items dependent on the parameters supplied (see [[Template:Item infobox#Auto-Typing|Auto-Typing]] and [[Template:Item infobox#Auto-Categorisation|Auto-Categorisation]] ).
<pre>
{{Item infobox
| name = 
| image =
| rarity = 
| type = 
| value = 
| stackable = 
| campaign = 
| collector =
| uses =
| alclevel = 
| sweetness =
| festiveness =
| questitem =
| commonsalvage =
| raresalvage =
| skill =
| skill2 =
| skill3 =
| skill4 =
| skill5 =
| skill6 =
| render = 
}}
</pre>

==Parameters==
; name : The name of the item. This may be omitted as it will default to the page name.

; image : The inventory icon of the item. The image should be .png format. This may be omitted as it will default to (<code><nowiki>{{PAGENAME}}.png</nowiki></code>).

; rarity : Rarity as per [[Item rarity]]. Given as a level:
:# Common (white or blue colour)
:# Uncommon (purple colour)
:# Rare (yellow colour)
:# Unique (green colour)
:# PvP reward (red colour)

; type : The type of the item. This may be omitted in some cases as the field will attempt to auto-type (see [[:Template:Item infobox#Auto-Typing|Auto-Typing]] for details).

; value : The [[Merchant]] value of the item. Specify as 'Can't be sold' in the case of quest items. Omit if the item is a [[Bundle]].

; stackable : Determines if the item can be put in a [[Item stacking|stack]] of identical items. Defaults to <code>yes</code>, unless its type has been specified to be [[Miniature]]s,[[Book]]s and [[Salvage item]], in which case it defaults to <code>no</code>. 
: For items that disappear on pickup and thus cannot be determined as stackable or unstackable, the value <code>disappears</code> can be used. 

; campaign : Can be a [[campaign]], [[expansion]], [[special event]], [[Beyond]] chapter or [[storyline]]. For a list of possible parameters, see [[Template:Infobox campaign row]].
: ''Note'': this parameter is named campaign for backwards compatibility.

; collector : The [[collector]]s that collect this item. Omit if the item is not a [[trophy]].

; uses : The number of uses for the item. This is for Kits, as opposed to single-use consumable items. Omit if the item is not a [[kit]].

; alclevel : The intoxication level of the item. Omit if the item is not [[alcohol]].

; sweetness : The number of points provided by consuming towards the [[Sweet]]s title track. Omit if zero (0).

; festiveness : The number of points provided by consuming towards the [[Festive item]]s title track. Omit if zero (0).

; questitem : The quests the item is involved in. Omit if the item is not a [[quest item]].

; commonsalvage: The common crafting materials this item can be salvaged into. Omit if the item cannot be salvaged, or the materials are not known.

; raresalvage: The rare crafting materials this item can be salvaged into. Omit if the item cannot be salvaged, or the materials are not known.

; skill: Optional. For consumables. Any skill activated by using the item.

; skill2..6: Optional. Applies only if ''skill'' is specified. Any other skill activated by using the item.

; render: The render image of the item. Setting render=default will set the image link to (<code><nowiki>[[Image:{{PAGENAME}} render.jpg|100px]]</nowiki></code>). Omit if the render is not available, or will not be used.

==Auto-typing==
Currently the item infobox will attempt to auto-type in the following order: 
* [[Alcohol]] : If the alclevel parameter is non-blank.
* [[Quest item]] : If the questitem parameter is non-blank.
* [[Trophy]] : If the collector parameter is non-blank.
* [[Salvage Item]] : If the commonsalvage or raresalvage parameters are non-blank.
* [[Kit]] : If the uses parameter is non-blank.
* Not Specified. 

Auto-typing refers to setting the default value of the type parameter, and will not occur if the type parameter is manually set. Currently, auto-typing is exclusive, meaning that an item can not be typed as two values.  If an item fulfills two sets of criteria, only the first fulfilled criteria will be used.

==Auto-categorisation==
Currently the item infobox attempts a number of auto-categorisation measures, as detailed below. Auto-categorisation works for single-term parameters only, so categories need to be set manually for items with multiple types. See [[Template:Material categorization]] regarding salvage categories.

Type categories:
* [[:Category:Quest items]] : Set if the type parameter is <nowiki>[[Quest item]]</nowiki>, or if the questitem parameter is non-blank.
* [[:Category:Alcohol]] : Set if the type parameter is <nowiki>[[Alcohol]]</nowiki>, or if the alclevel parameter is non-blank.
* [[:Category:Trophies]] : Set if the type parameter is <nowiki>[[Trophy]]</nowiki>, or if the collector parameter is non-blank.
* [[:Category:Kits]] : Set if the type parameter is <nowiki>[[Kit]]</nowiki>.
* [[:Category:Salvage items]] : Set if the type parameter is <nowiki>[[Salvage item]]</nowiki>.
* [[:Category:Bundles]] : Set if the type parameter is <nowiki>[[Bundle]]</nowiki>.
* [[:Category:Scrolls]] : Set if the type parameter is <nowiki>[[Scroll]]</nowiki>.
* [[:Category:Common crafting materials]] : Set if the type parameter is <nowiki>[[Common crafting material]]</nowiki>. 
* [[:Category:Rare crafting materials]] : Set if the type parameter is <nowiki>[[Rare crafting material]]</nowiki>. 
* [[:Category:Miniatures]] : Set if the type parameter is <nowiki>[[Miniature]]</nowiki>. 
* [[:Category:Keys]] : Set if the type parameter is <nowiki>[[Key]]</nowiki>. 

Common salvage categories:
* [[:Category:Contains iron]] : Set if the commonsalvage parameter is <nowiki>[[Iron Ingot]]s</nowiki>.
* [[:Category:Contains cloth]] : Set if the commonsalvage parameter is <nowiki>[[Bolt of Cloth|Bolts of Cloth]]</nowiki>.
* [[:Category:Contains wood]] : Set if the commonsalvage parameter is <nowiki>[[Wood Plank]]s</nowiki>.
* [[:Category:Contains dust]] : Set if the commonsalvage parameter is <nowiki>[[Pile of Glittering Dust|Piles of Glittering Dust]]</nowiki>.
* [[:Category:Contains hide]] : Set if the commonsalvage parameter is <nowiki>[[Tanned Hide Square]]s</nowiki>.
* [[:Category:Contains scale]] : Set if the commonsalvage parameter is <nowiki>[[Scale]]s</nowiki>.
* [[:Category:Contains bone]] : Set if the commonsalvage parameter is <nowiki>[[Bone]]s</nowiki>.
* [[:Category:Contains chitin]] : Set if the commonsalvage parameter is <nowiki>[[Chitin Fragment]]s</nowiki>.
* [[:Category:Contains feather]] : Set if the commonsalvage parameter is <nowiki>[[Feather]]s</nowiki>.
* [[:Category:Contains granite]] : Set if the commonsalvage parameter is <nowiki>[[Granite Slab]]s</nowiki>.
* [[:Category:Contains fiber]] : Set if the commonsalvage parameter is <nowiki>[[Plant Fiber]]s</nowiki>.

Rare salvage categories:
* [[:Category:Contains steel]] : Set if the raresalvage parameter is <nowiki>[[Steel Ingot]]s</nowiki>.
* [[:Category:Contains leather]] : Set if the raresalvage parameter is <nowiki>[[Leather Square]]s</nowiki>.
* [[:Category:Contains linen]] : Set if the raresalvage parameter is <nowiki>[[Bolt of Linen|Bolts of Linen]]</nowiki>.
* [[:Category:Contains silk]] : Set if the raresalvage parameter is <nowiki>[[Bolt of Silk|Bolts of Silk]]</nowiki>.
* [[:Category:Contains fur]] : Set if the raresalvage parameter is <nowiki>[[Fur Square]]s</nowiki>.
* [[:Category:Contains parchment]] : Set if the raresalvage parameter is <nowiki>[[Roll of Parchment|Rolls of Parchment]]</nowiki>.
* [[:Category:Contains amber]] : Set if the raresalvage parameter is <nowiki>[[Amber Chunk]]s</nowiki>.
* [[:Category:Contains jadeite]] : Set if the raresalvage parameter is <nowiki>[[Jadeite Shard]]s</nowiki>.
* [[:Category:Contains spiritwood]] : Set if the raresalvage parameter is <nowiki>[[Spiritwood Plank]]s</nowiki>.
* [[:Category:Contains tempered glass]] : Set if the raresalvage parameter is <nowiki>[[Tempered Glass Vial]]s</nowiki>.
* [[:Category:Contains ink]] : Set if the raresalvage parameter is <nowiki>[[Vial of Ink|Vials of Ink]]</nowiki>.
* [[:Category:Contains charcoal]] : Set if the raresalvage parameter is <nowiki>[[Lump of Charcoal|Lumps of Charcoal]]</nowiki>.
* [[:Category:Contains monstrous fang]] : Set if the raresalvage parameter is <nowiki>[[Monstrous Fang]]s</nowiki>.
* [[:Category:Contains ruby]] : Set if the raresalvage parameter is <nowiki>[[Ruby|Rubies]]</nowiki>.
* [[:Category:Contains sapphire]] : Set if the raresalvage parameter is <nowiki>[[Sapphire]]s</nowiki>.
* [[:Category:Contains diamond]] : Set if the raresalvage parameter is <nowiki>[[Diamond]]s</nowiki>.

